e provider's own i18next instance. Before: no hint. After: 'Shown as “Order Total” in en: …'. With the input set to the translation: no hint. With the input changed again: the hint came back. On an untranslated field: no hint. With &locale=zh-CN: '在 en 中显示为“Order Total”：…'. No page errors. The showcase Studio reading is NOT MEASURED (see deviations).",
